# Build 027 — electron-builder Windows installer/portable output (tens to
# hundreds of MB per artifact). Reproducible any time via
# `npm run desktop:installer` / `npm run desktop:portable` inside /app;
# only the SHA-256 checksums and build report are committed, not the
# binaries themselves.
/release

# Build 013 (Portfolio Intelligence): the raw 5,000-pattern generation
# manifest and its resume checkpoint are large (tens of MB) intermediate
# working data, not the "lightweight manifest" artifact the build brief asks
# to ship — only the summarized outputs (BUILD_013_METRICS.json,
# BUILD_013_REPORT.md, sampled contact sheets) are committed.
docs/build_reports/baselines/BUILD_013_portfolio_raw.json
docs/build_reports/baselines/BUILD_013_portfolio_checkpoint.json
# The uncurated contact sheet embeds 60 full-detail SVGs inline (~23MB) —
# reproducible any time via `npx tsx scripts/portfolioVisuals.ts`; only its
# small manifest.json (which pattern IDs/scores were sampled) is committed.
docs/build_reports/build_013_visuals/uncurated_contact_sheet.html
